ore execution, or at all. 'output_dir' method now called\nin the 'run' method, after the check for running 'clean' and 'pdf2png' methods.", "created_at": "2015-11-06T19:07:33Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ec3b2bebc751024ef2bea18acd56b0e52ab795f0", "message": "Adds padding to file name. Updates example in README.", "created_at": "2015-10-23T19:50:01Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9879f36c9423cb3eee0593ffa5d8bea4df93994b", "message": "Updating Setup", "created_at": "2015-02-25T20:46:22Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3d48631f335d08d83fd7fe05a6b20b634908b9fe", "message": "Add Description header", "created_at": "2015-02-25T17:12:40Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "30d3512baabbb8ebff73aca4c574ffb5709dee6a", "message": "update description again.", "created_at": "2015-02-25T17:11:30Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "013c69d792427d232788131ef04fd71d7aff0d66", "message": "Update description", "created_at": "2015-02-25T17:07:52Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b3e7b6163b3a1d9703e4e880c92faf3f24bcb18a", "message": "Update description.", "created_at": "2015-02-25T17:04:56Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2bab7870ba6a79b29f17ea3b7f5a87eccda4c186", "message": "Update description.", "created_at": "2015-02-25T17:03:29Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1af608673e24810b72f47e03cb0d8679ba9eeb37", "message": "Add cowl image to Readme", "created_at": "2015-02-25T14:27:05Z", "repo": "cowl", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "227d4